    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Mahony Walsh & Associates Ltd are delighted to present this charming 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom detached bungalow, ideally situated just minutes from Kilmurry Village and within easy reach of the highly accessible N22 road network.\n\nSet on a generous site extending to over c. 1.1 acre, the property enjoys a peaceful countryside setting with substantial outdoor space and a selection of useful sheds and outbuildings. The extensive grounds offer excellent potential for the keen gardener, hobbyist or those simply seeking the benefits of additional space and country living.\nWhile the property would benefit from modernisation, it presents an exciting opportunity for prospective purchasers to renovate, reimagine or potentially extend the existing accommodation to create a home tailored to their own requirements, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\n\nOffering space, potential and a convenient rural location, this property represents a wonderful opportunity for those looking to put their own stamp on a countryside home.\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the potential on offer!\n\nBER: F\n\n \nAgent: Mark Walsh Tel: 087 349 3066\n\nAMV 260,000\n\nAccommondation Details:\n\nPorch & Hallway 4.50m & 1.45m\nThe front door opens into a warm and welcoming entrance with laminate flooring throughout. \n\nLiving Room 4.50m & 4.44m \nSpacious living room with carpet flooring and wood-burning stove. \n\nKitchen/Dining 6.32m x 2.55m\nBright galley style kitchen with laminate flooring, and rear door entrance.\n\nSitting Room 4.50m x 4.44m\nCarpet Flooring and gas fireplace. \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.48m x 2.72m \nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, \n\nBedroom 2 - 3.00m x 2.63m \nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring with built in storage. \n\nBedroom 3 3.48m x 1.98m \nSmall double bedroom with carpet flooring.\n\nMain Bathroom 2.16m x 1.66m \nTiled bathroom with W.HB, W.C and enclosed electric shower. \n\nGarden Details\nSet on approximately 1.1 acres, the property offers an impressive amount of outdoor space together with a selection of useful outbuildings and sheds. The generous grounds provide excellent scope for gardening, growing your own produce, keeping a substantial vegetable garden or simply creating an attractive outdoor space to enjoy.\n\nThe existing sheds and outbuildings are a particularly valuable feature, offering plenty of room for tools, equipment, storage and workshop space. For the keen gardener, hobbyist or anyone looking for a property with room to pursue outdoor interests, there is enormous potential here.\n\nShed 1- 6m x 12m\nShed 2 7m x 10m\n\nWith the residence, outbuildings and extensive grounds all contained within the holding, this is a property where a new owner can really put their own stamp on the outdoor space and make the most of its countryside setting.\n\nHeating \nOil Central Heating \n\nBER Details\nBER: F \n\n\n"
      },
